{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategy meets physics, action, and co-op</h2><br><strong>No barriers to entry \u2013 the fight starts immediately.</strong><br>In <strong>Hexabot Stranded: Defend or Die</strong>, you control a small repair robot stranded on a hostile world. Build your defenses, survive enemy swarms, gather resources \u2013 and find a way back home.<br><br><strong>Play solo or team up in local 2-player co-op \u2013 anytime.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><strong>Defend. Upgrade. Survive.</strong><br>Build defense towers and place them freely across the battlefield. Carry them to new spots, combine their effects, and keep your base alive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/5c33d73189d1809a33d15e1901de997f.poster.avif?t=1752311960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/5c33d73189d1809a33d15e1901de997f.webm?t=1752311960\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/5c33d73189d1809a33d15e1901de997f.mp4?t=1752311960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Swarm-based enemy behavior</strong><br>Enemies attack in tight formations and put your defenses to the test. Stay mobile \u2013 and respond fast.<br><br><strong>Action tower defense with full control</strong><br>No passive camera here: you move your bot directly, dodge attacks, block paths, and defend your base in real time.<br><br><strong>Use your surroundings \u2013 physics is on your side</strong><br>Throw objects, block enemies, use recoil \u2013 everything follows real physics. The terrain and environment become part of your strategy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/19a260408435a0f3195f181742f6ebd5.poster.avif?t=1752311960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/19a260408435a0f3195f181742f6ebd5.webm?t=1752311960\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/19a260408435a0f3195f181742f6ebd5.mp4?t=1752311960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Collect resources and power up</strong><br>Every wave leaves you with limited time. Grab what you can and invest in faster movement, stronger towers, better weapons, and active abilities.<br><br><strong>Solo or co-op \u2013 your choice</strong><br>Play the campaign alone or with a friend. A second player can jump in anytime for local split-screen action. <strong>Find joint strategies, divide roles, and survive together.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/0ce7f47ac5959677db41a1b1e9ea2168.poster.avif?t=1752311960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/0ce7f47ac5959677db41a1b1e9ea2168.webm?t=1752311960\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/0ce7f47ac5959677db41a1b1e9ea2168.mp4?t=1752311960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">For players who love:</h2>\t\u2022\tTower defense with direct movement and combat<br>\t\u2022\tCo-op games that reward real teamwork<br>\t\u2022\tPhysics-driven gameplay with meaningful interaction<br>\t\u2022\tA smart mix of action, strategy, and progression<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TL;DR</h2><br><strong>You\u2019re stranded. Everything wants you dead. But you\u2019re not defenseless.</strong><br>Build your base, use the world around you, level up \u2013 and fight your way back to safety.<br><strong>Hexabot Stranded: Defend or Die</strong> blends classic tower defense with real-time action, local co-op, and physics-based gameplay.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846340?t=1752311960","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/8f109b3548c1abbe2137512d584651d6ee72d7ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752311960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/12d96e762a0ad24009b8bfaf14906728eaf6210d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752311960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/12d96e762a0ad24009b8bfaf14906728eaf6210d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752311960","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategy meets physics, action, and co-op</h2><br><strong>No barriers to entry \u2013 the fight starts immediately.</strong><br>In <strong>Hexabot Stranded: Defend or Die</strong>, you control a small repair robot stranded on a hostile world. Build your defenses, survive enemy swarms, gather resources \u2013 and find a way back home.<br><br><strong>Play solo or team up in local 2-player co-op \u2013 anytime.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><strong>Defend. Upgrade. Survive.</strong><br>Build defense towers and place them freely across the battlefield. Carry them to new spots, combine their effects, and keep your base alive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as